---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---
<BaseLayout title="Terms & Conditions" description="The terms and conditions for purchasing from aPaulogy.">
  <div class="container-page py-16 prose-paper">
    <h1 class="text-5xl mb-6">Terms &amp; Conditions</h1>
    <p class="text-[var(--color-muted)]">Last updated: August 2026</p>
    <p>Welcome to aPaulogy. By using this website and placing an order, you agree to the terms below. Please read them carefully.</p>
    <h2>Products &amp; artwork</h2>
    <p>All artwork on this site is the original creation of Paul Fernandes and is protected by copyright. Products sold are authorised reproductions. Colours may vary slightly from screen to print owing to the nature of watercolour and individual displays.</p>
    <h2>Orders &amp; pricing</h2>
    <p>All prices are listed in Indian Rupees (₹) and are inclusive of applicable taxes unless stated otherwise. We reserve the right to correct pricing errors and to decline or cancel any order.</p>
    <h2>Payments</h2>
    <p>Payments are processed securely through Razorpay. We do not store your card details. An order is confirmed only once payment is successfully captured.</p>
    <h2>Shipping</h2>
    <p>Estimated dispatch and delivery timelines are provided on the <a href="/faq/#shipping">FAQ</a>. Title and risk pass to you on delivery.</p>
    <h2>Returns &amp; damages</h2>
    <p>As pieces are made to order we are unable to accept returns for change of mind. If your order arrives damaged, contact us within 7 days with photographs and we will arrange a replacement.</p>
    <h2>Intellectual property</h2>
    <p>You may not reproduce, resell or commercially exploit any artwork or content from this site without written permission.</p>
    <h2>Contact</h2>
    <p>Questions about these terms? Reach us via the <a href="/contact/">contact page</a>.</p>
  </div>
</BaseLayout>
